hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"102","[AI-translation] Hamein Abdullah bin Abdur Rehman ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hamein Muhammad bin Isa yani Ibn-e-Tibba' ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hamein Abbad bin Al-Awwaam ne riwayat ki, Sa'eed bin Abi Arooba se, Qataada se, Anas bin Malik se: Ke woh sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne daheen haath mein angoothi pehante the."
"103","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Ubaidullah Al-Muharibi ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hamein Abdul Aziz bin Abi Hazim ne riwayat ki, Musa bin Uqba se, Nafi' se, Ibn-e-Umar se, farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sonay ki angoothi banwayi, toh aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam usay daheen haath mein pehnte the, phir logon ne bhi sonay ki angoothiyan bana leen, toh aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne usay utaar diya, aur farmaya: Main isay hargiz nahi pehnunga. Toh logon ne bhi apni angoothiyan utaar di."
"104","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashshaar ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hamein Wahb bin Jareer ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hamein mere abba ne riwayat ki, Qataada se, Anas se, kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki talwaar ka qabee'a chandi ka tha."
"105","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashshaar ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hamein Mu'aaz bin Hishaam ne riwayat ki, kaha: Mujhe mere abba ne riwayat ki, Qataada se, Sa'eed bin Abi Hasan se, kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki talwaar ka qabee'a chandi ka tha."
